===Mirage Island===
While {{rt|130|Hoenn}} usually appears as an empty stretch of ocean, under very rare circumstances, [[Mirage Island (Generation III)|Mirage Island]] may appear in the middle of the route. This island is home only to {{p|Wynaut}}, and a soft soil patch grows a single [[Liechi Berry]]. If held by a Pokémon during battle, this Berry increases a Pokémon's physical {{stat|Attack}} in a pinch.
{{-}}
